# Architecture decision records (daily-magic / Agent Witch)

Canonical index: [docs/adr/README.md](docs/adr/README.md). Full text lives in `docs/adr/NNNN-*.md`.

## When to load

| Change area | ADR |
| ----------- | --- |
| `server.ts`, WebSocket upgrade, Mac `wsUrl` | 0002, 0006 |
| `getAgentWitchHub`, presence, devices API, writer dispatch, outbox | 0005 |
| `src/features/*` vs `src/lib/*` layout | 0003 |
| FSA, `public-api/`, `internal/`, hubs | 0007 |
| Cursor Cloud dispatch, origin checks | 0004 |
| Deploy, Railway, Neon, `www.agentwitch.com` | 0006, `docs/product/repo-name-and-hosting.md` |
| New numbered ADR | 0001 (process) |

## Catalog

| ADR | Decision |
| --- | -------- |
| 0001 | ADRs under `docs/adr/`; feature-knowledge index for agents |
| 0002 | `tsx server.ts` for `/api/agent-witch/ws`; hardcoded production `wss://www.agentwitch.com/...` |
| 0003 | Features in `src/features/`; shared server code in `src/lib/`; API routes in `src/app/api/` |
| 0004 | Cursor Cloud dispatch requires allowed app origin in production |
| 0005 | `agent_witch_connections` + dispatch outbox; presence tiers; writer needs `live` on same Node; unified `resolveLiveAgentClientsByDeviceIdForUser` |
| 0006 | Production on Railway + Docker + `npm start`; Neon `DATABASE_URL`; not CHECK24 daily-magic URL |
| 0007 | Fractal slices: segregated `public-api`, private `internal/`, hubs for cross-feature integration; incremental migration |

## Rules

- Do not contradict an **Accepted** ADR; update the ADR when product behavior changes.
- Open operational caveats (DNS, multi-instance handoff) stay in `src/features/agent-witch/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`, not duplicated as historical AGENT-* tickets in ADRs.
